    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisileereunet anakiruja a ŋina aya ŋityaŋ ŋiomwon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo esyaunan ipukat Belisasar Babilon, abu Daniel kiruja ka abu kiŋolik ŋakisileerekineta apaki ŋina aperyo iŋes alokitaada. Abu nai iŋes kigir ŋakiro ŋuna erujae iŋes tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Anakisileerekinet a ŋina abu ayoŋ eŋolik nakwaare, abu ayoŋ eŋolik ekuwuam ŋolo akutunit alowaetin a ŋuluomwon a daadaŋ, ŋolo akutunit ananam a ŋina apolon nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋityaŋ ŋiomwon ŋulu apolok nooi tolomut ananam, agelegelaka ŋityaŋ ŋul daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekwaan ŋolo esyaunan ka eŋatuny nai ayakar ŋabebenuk ŋuna ekwaan ka ŋuna a egole, ani eriŋa ayoŋ etee iŋes, eŋolik ŋabebenuk keŋ edotoryo anakuwan keŋ, kitonyounoe etyaŋ alokwap ido kimyekinae towo a ŋakejen a ŋaarei esibit ituŋanan ka aponi inakinae iŋes ŋatameta ŋuna a ituŋanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totakanu nabo etyaŋ ece ŋolo a ŋiarei ŋolo ekwaan ka etyaŋ ŋolo adedeŋan, aponi etyaŋ kitonyounoe ke epeiwae, ayakar etyaŋ ŋol ŋikyal ŋiuni ŋulu apolok nakituk keŋ ŋina aya ŋikyal ŋuluce ka aponi tolimokinae ebe, ‘Tonyou tonyam ŋawat ŋuna alalak.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋol eriŋa ayoŋ ete iŋes, abu ece totakanu ŋolo ekwaan ka eris, ayakar etyaŋ ŋol kaku keŋ ŋabebenuk ŋuna ikwaan ka ŋuna a ikyeny ka eyakar etyaŋ ŋol ŋakyes ŋaomwon, aponi inakinae iŋes apedor ŋinakipukaet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedaun ŋun, abu nabo eŋolik anakisileerekinet a ŋina abu ayoŋ eŋolik nakwaare etyaŋ ŋolo a ŋiomwon, arae etyaŋ ŋol ŋolo ikiteryaŋakini ŋolo ikitubuli ka arae ŋolo agogoŋon nooi, ayakar etyaŋ ŋol ŋikyal ŋulu aburok ŋulu arae ŋasuwa, anyami iŋes ibore apaki ŋin ka anyilinyili icakit ŋanyile. Agelaana etyaŋ ŋol alotooma ŋityaŋ daadaŋ ŋulu a ekiŋaren ka ayakar ŋamomwar ŋatomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa ayoŋ ete ŋamomwar a etyaŋ a ŋol, abu ayoŋ eŋolik amomwara ace ŋina adit alokidiŋ ŋamomwar ŋunatomon. Abu amomwara ŋin kilunyokin neni a ŋamomwar a ŋauni a ŋuna aponi toditarae anakou a etyaŋ. Aya daŋ namomwara ŋin ŋakonyen ŋuna ekwaan ka ŋuna a ituŋanan, ayakar daŋ etyaŋ ŋol akituk ŋina erworo ŋakiro ŋuna ka akituro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akinyasuno a ŋapukasinei a ŋituŋa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani eriŋa ayoŋ ete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisileereunoe apolou a ŋakiro a ŋuna abu Daniel kiŋolik anakiruja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu Daniel tema, “Ani eruwor ayoŋ, eryaŋakina etau kaŋ, eketubulito ayoŋ ŋakiro ŋuna abu ayoŋ eŋolik anakiruja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ olot neni a epei a ŋolo awoi a nen ka eŋit iŋes apolou a ŋakiro a ŋun a daadaŋ. Aŋun, abu iŋes okolimok ayoŋ atemar eketeyenikini apolou a ŋakiro a ŋun, ido abu tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Itoodiunito ŋityaŋ ŋuluomwon ŋul, ŋirwosi ŋiomwon ŋulu moi eruwor ŋikepukak anakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ijaarete ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Akuj a ŋina alokidiama nooi apukan kituruwosi ŋina kec ŋikaru ka ŋikaru, kire jik eruwor apukan ŋina kec ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abu ayoŋ eitan ayenun ŋuna a kire ŋuna a etyaŋ a ŋolo a ŋiomwon, a ŋolo agelaana aneni a ŋityaŋ a ŋuluce a daadaŋ, arae etyaŋ ŋol ŋolo ikitubuli nooi ite, ayakar etyaŋ ŋol ŋikyal ŋulu arae ŋasuwa ka ŋimeeger ŋulu arae eburonis ŋulu anyamya iŋes ibore enyilinyili icakit ŋanyile; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu daŋ ayoŋ eitan ŋuna a ayenun a ŋamomwar a ŋunatomon a ŋuna aya nakou keŋ ka amomwara ŋinace ŋina arupuni ekaku, ido toditarae ŋamomwar ŋunauni, amomwara ŋina ayakar ŋakonyen ka akituk ŋina erworo ŋakiro ŋuna ka akituro, ŋina asibit iŋes apol akilo ŋunace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa ayoŋ ete, abu eŋolik amomwara ŋin itijikini ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Akuj, tosodi eloununui ikes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "apotu ŋun kitiyas akitodol ŋina abunio ŋolo iboi ŋikaru ka ŋikaru, ŋolo abu totub ŋakiro eikinit ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Akuj a ŋina alokidiama nooi, tosodi abu todol apaki ŋina aponiata ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Akuj toruworos ŋikepukak.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
